                                "sense_id": "0ffad3d4-a480-3c7c-8829-c82e6b1ef560",
                                "text": "\"Why don't you use a raticide?\" his friend suggested.\n\"But, what is a raticide?\" asked Kartar innocently.\n\"It is a material which helps the rat to commit suicide,\" his friend told him, his eyes showing humour for a minute."
                            },
