                                "sense_id": "0ffad3d4-a480-3c7c-8829-c82e6b1ef560",
                                "text": "For the second time that morning, Philippe led the way through the house to the cellar, a large canister of raticide under one arm, a stack of cartons, folded flat, under the other."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a692fe18-25ac-4189-adc4-06ff77b551db",
                                "sense_id": "0ffad3d4-a480-3c7c-8829-c82e6b1ef560",
                                "text": "Red squill is the principal raticide."
